<title>UK: House of Fraser names financial adviser.</title>
<headline>House of Fraser names financial adviser.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>House of Fraser Plc on Friday said it named Merrill Lynch International as financial advisers and UBS Ltd as corporate brokers.</p>
<p>&quot;The group looks forward to working closely with its new banking and broking advisers who, the board, believes, provide the expertise to support the next phase of House of Fraser's development and the future growth of the group, under the executive leadership of John Coleman,&quot; chairman Brian McGowan said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
